@page "/"

<PageTitle>beeday Frontend Lab</PageTitle>

<section aria-labelledby="lab-home-heading">
    <h1 id="lab-home-heading">beeday Frontend Lab</h1>
    <p>
        This is the empty bootstrap shell for the beeday Frontend Lab (EPIC 33, Sprint 33.5).
        It is independently runnable, requires no database, no production authentication, and no
        production backend. It exists to become a deterministic, database-free workspace for
        visual development and owner review of the beeday Experience System.
    </p>
    <p>
        <code>DS-Asyst/BeeDay</code> remains the only runtime/business source of truth. See
        <code>ADR-008</code> in that repository for the full architecture and boundary contract.
    </p>
</section>
